FallbackMigrationTest
└── when migrate() runs and tier-1 (tryMigrate) cannot produce LP
    ├── it falls through to tier-2 on the strategy-hook pool and mints when the configured hook reverts
    ├── it releases assets when no currency was raised/swept
    ├── it releases assets when swept currency does not match the reported raise
    ├── it releases assets when the fallback price is invalid
    ├── it releases assets when the strategy-hook pool is already initialized
    ├── it releases assets when PositionManager modifyLiquidities always reverts (tier-3 emergency)
    └── it rejects reentrancy from leftoverRecipient.receive() back into migrate
